docs {
  # SystemService.GetHealth

  Overall state plus, when asked, the database and Redis

  `/ltedu.system.v1.SystemService/GetHealth` · unary · `ltedu/system/v1/system.proto`

  ## Request — `GetHealthRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `include_db` | `bool` |  |
  | `include_redis` | `bool` |  |

  ## Response — `GetHealthResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `status` | `string` | ok \| degraded |
  | `service` | `string` |  |
  | `timestamp` | `Timestamp` |  |
  | `db` | `optional ComponentStatus` | Set only when asked for |
  | `redis` | `optional ComponentStatus` |  |

  ## Tipos

  ### `ComponentStatus`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `status` | `string` | ok \| degraded |
  | `latency` | `string` | Round trip of the ping, e.g. "1.2ms" |

  Errores: status gRPC con un `ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail` (code, message, fields) en los details.
}
